@startuml
' 背景色とフォント設定
skinparam backgroundColor #F0F0F0
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

' ライフラインとメッセージ色
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #888888
skinparam sequenceMessageColor DarkGreen
skinparam sequenceArrowColor DarkBlue

' 参加者（participant）ごとの背景・枠線色設定
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #EEF7FF
skinparam participantBorderColor #1F78C1

participant Client
participant Server
participant DB

Client -> Server: HTTP Request
activate Server

Server -> DB: SELECT * FROM users
activate DB
DB --> Server: Query Result
deactivate DB

Server --> Client: HTTP Response
deactivate Server
@enduml
